WEBVTT

00:01.820 --> 00:04.340
<i>Where am I?</i>

00:04.840 --> 00:05.850
<i>Right.</i>

00:05.850 --> 00:08.030
<i>I was suddenly enveloped in light...</i>

00:08.030 --> 00:09.970
<i>And then...</i>

00:09.970 --> 00:10.990
<i>I...</i>

00:12.470 --> 00:13.750
Welcome.

00:14.530 --> 00:17.520
You have been summoned to Mildgard

00:17.520 --> 00:20.110
by the otherworlder summoning spell.

00:21.060 --> 00:23.620
I am the Lady Nolyn.

00:25.430 --> 00:26.980
I'm sorry!

00:26.980 --> 00:28.370
<i>Huh?</i>

00:28.370 --> 00:32.740
It seems you were caught up in a 
summoning meant for other people.

00:33.160 --> 00:37.640
<i>I thought you just said that 
I had been summoned here?</i>

00:38.020 --> 00:40.630
Uh, let me explain.

00:40.630 --> 00:43.810
The otherworlder summoning
randomly selects

00:40.640 --> 00:41.390
<b>Other World
Catcher</b>

00:40.640 --> 00:46.850
<b>To Mildgard</b>

00:41.390 --> 00:42.100
<b>Other World
Catcher</b>

00:42.100 --> 00:43.020
<b>Other World
Catcher</b>

00:43.020 --> 00:43.480
<b>Other World
Catcher</b>

00:43.480 --> 00:44.480
<b>Other World
Catcher</b>

00:43.810 --> 00:46.520
from countless targets across 
a multitude of worlds.

00:44.480 --> 00:44.730
<b>Other World
Catcher</b>

00:44.730 --> 00:45.770
<b>Other World
Catcher</b>

00:45.770 --> 00:46.850
<b>Other World
Catcher</b>

00:46.860 --> 00:50.060
You were excluded from the list of 
targets, but somehow it picked you up.

00:50.320 --> 00:51.790
<i>I wasn't a target?</i>

00:51.790 --> 00:56.390
To start with, the otherworlder summoning 
spell is a very dangerous spell!

00:56.940 --> 01:00.070
The laws of this world and 
Earth are too different,

01:00.070 --> 01:03.740
so it carried the risk of 
Mildgard itself collapsing.

01:04.590 --> 01:06.850
That's why it was forbidden!

01:06.850 --> 01:10.490
But that damn nation activated 
it under reckless conditions!

01:10.490 --> 01:12.360
<i>A goddess just cursed...</i>

01:12.910 --> 01:16.630
When I noticed its 
activation, I intervened,

01:16.630 --> 01:18.360
but I couldn't stop it...

01:18.360 --> 01:20.190
So, for now, I've brought you here.

01:20.190 --> 01:23.830
<i>Then the others who were 
summoned are here, too?</i>

01:23.830 --> 01:26.460
No, the proper targets of the spell

01:26.460 --> 01:30.690
were safely summoned to the place where the 
spell was activated: the Holy Sidonia Empire

01:31.140 --> 01:36.320
<i>So to sum it up, I was a 
mistake. Is that right?</i>

01:36.320 --> 01:37.620
Yes, a mistake.

01:37.620 --> 01:40.210
<i>Then please return me to where I came from!</i>

01:40.510 --> 01:42.780
I'm sorry. I can't do that.

01:42.780 --> 01:43.400
<i>Huh?!</i>

01:43.400 --> 01:45.930
I mean, I got so <i>ticked off!</i>

01:45.930 --> 01:49.800
So I patched things so they could never 
use that forbidden spell a second time!

01:50.170 --> 01:51.610
Then...

01:51.610 --> 01:52.580
<i>Then?</i>

01:52.580 --> 01:54.960
So you see, that patch...

01:54.960 --> 01:58.630
It deals with the distortion between the 
laws of the worlds caused by the summoning spell.

01:58.630 --> 02:00.650
First, to deal with the 
composition of the air, it—

02:00.650 --> 02:02.890
<i>Um, can we just jump to the summary?</i>

02:05.030 --> 02:07.200
I made it so you can't return to your world.

02:07.200 --> 02:08.110
<i>No way!</i>

02:08.110 --> 02:10.180
You also don't have a 
body to return to anymore.

02:10.180 --> 02:11.230
<i>I don't have a body?!</i>

02:11.230 --> 02:12.400
<i>Why?!</i>

02:12.400 --> 02:15.710
I guess you caught all kinds of blowback 
since you were excluded from the targets.

02:15.710 --> 02:17.190
I really am sorry!

02:17.760 --> 02:20.190
<i>You can't just apologize
like that! It's not okay!</i>

02:20.410 --> 02:22.260
<i>What's going to happen to me?!</i>

02:22.260 --> 02:27.540
I would ask you to give up and 
retry life as a resident of Mildgard.

02:27.540 --> 02:28.840
<i>Retry?</i>

02:28.840 --> 02:34.010
<i>Then am I also going to be 
summoned to that Sidonia place?</i>

02:34.270 --> 02:36.350
That would be possible,

02:36.350 --> 02:40.250
but the Holy Sidonia Empire 
is a problematic place.

02:40.250 --> 02:42.230
Since you were caught up by accident,

02:42.230 --> 02:44.330
your treatment there would be rather awful.

02:44.640 --> 02:47.390
<i>Why would they do that after summoning me?</i>

02:47.390 --> 02:49.010
Because you're not a target.

02:49.010 --> 02:50.800
Oh, right.

02:51.060 --> 02:52.680
Now, now!

02:52.680 --> 02:54.260
I have an idea!

02:54.260 --> 02:57.070
I do feel guilty about what happened to you,

02:57.070 --> 03:02.010
so I'm thinking of sending you to a 
different nation with my super support!

03:02.400 --> 03:04.140
As an apology, you'll have my blessing, too.

03:04.140 --> 03:04.910
Well?

03:04.910 --> 03:06.160
<i>Well... Blessing...</i>

03:06.160 --> 03:09.900
They have them in the games, novels, 
and anime you have in Japan, right?

03:09.900 --> 03:12.350
I'm sending you to a
fantasy world, just like in those!

03:12.350 --> 03:13.620
Exciting, isn't it?

03:13.620 --> 03:15.740
<i>I have nothing but anxiety about it.</i>

03:15.740 --> 03:17.540
<i>There are monsters too, right?</i>

03:17.540 --> 03:19.470
<i>Like goblins and dragons?</i>

03:19.470 --> 03:24.100
And that is what my
super support is for! Right?

03:24.100 --> 03:25.190
<i>Ah...</i>

03:25.190 --> 03:26.110
Then it's settled!

03:26.110 --> 03:28.560
Now, try to will "Status."

03:30.610 --> 03:31.870
<i>Status.</i>

03:33.270 --> 03:34.640
<i>Seventeen?!</i>

03:33.270 --> 03:36.110
Name

