<i>And what's a "job" here?</i>

03:36.420 --> 03:39.850
<i>I was a salaryman. Going on 40—</i>

03:39.850 --> 03:41.540
Who cares about the past?

03:41.540 --> 03:44.190
Also, there are no salarymen on Mildgard.

03:44.190 --> 03:45.440
Let's see...

03:44.200 --> 04:06.180
<b>Production Jobs</b>

03:44.200 --> 04:06.180
<b>Combat Jobs</b>

03:45.440 --> 03:46.850
Hero and warrior are two possible jobs,

03:46.850 --> 03:48.770
or if you want to aim for 
an adventuring one,

03:48.770 --> 03:52.680
there's swordsman, mage, 
knight, thief, and hunter.

03:48.830 --> 04:06.180
<b>Swordsman</b>

03:49.290 --> 04:06.180
<b>Mage</b>

03:50.330 --> 04:06.180
<b>Knight</b>

03:50.700 --> 04:06.180
<b>Thief</b>

03:51.330 --> 04:06.180
<b>Hunter</b>

03:53.030 --> 03:54.780
Production jobs include

03:54.540 --> 04:06.180
<b>Herbalist</b>

03:54.780 --> 03:58.890
herbalist, alchemist, blacksmith, 
carpenter, and others.

03:55.250 --> 04:06.180
<b>Alchemist</b>

03:56.630 --> 04:06.180
<b>Blacksmith</b>

03:57.290 --> 04:06.180
<b>Carpenter</b>

03:59.320 --> 04:02.200
<i>I can't go out looking for 
trouble and fighting,</i>

04:02.200 --> 04:04.210
<i>so that leaves the production jobs.</i>

04:04.210 --> 04:04.850
How plain.

04:04.850 --> 04:06.180
<i>Leave me be!</i>

04:06.180 --> 04:09.540
If you utilize the skills you 
acquire through your actions,

04:09.540 --> 04:11.640
then you'll be able to obtain a job.

04:11.640 --> 04:12.920
<i>What's this?</i>

04:12.180 --> 04:13.880
If you want to aim for a production job,

04:13.880 --> 04:15.860
then I'll give you a 
spell useful for those,

04:15.860 --> 04:18.920
the recovery magic you'll 
need to protect yourself,

04:18.920 --> 04:21.650
and a few other things I can put together.

04:25.110 --> 04:27.930
<i>What's this? What's going on?</i>

04:27.930 --> 04:30.080
<i>Argh! My head hurts!</i>

04:30.570 --> 04:33.920
Okay, have a nice trip to 
the continent of Asgard!

04:33.920 --> 04:35.820
Work hard and live a good life!

04:34.870 --> 04:38.000
<i>You're doing this to me 
without any explanation?!</i>

06:08.180 --> 06:12.970
<b>Episode 1
I Was Summoned By Accident</b>

06:08.180 --> 06:12.970
<b>Episode 1
