07:40.340 --> 07:43.470
<i>It's used in mages' staves and magic items.</i>

07:42.980 --> 07:49.490
<b>Treant Wood</b>

07:43.470 --> 07:45.880
<i>It's also useful for spear shafts.</i>

07:45.880 --> 07:47.100
This is great!

07:47.100 --> 07:49.200
Maybe I can work it using 
the Blacksmithing skill.

07:49.730 --> 07:50.900
