08:19.600 --> 08:22.810
<b>A skill specially created by Lady Nolyn. It provides infinite storage space,
 automatic sorting, and chronostasis. Incapable of storing living creatures.</b>

08:23.250 --> 08:25.530
Thank you, Lady Nolyn!

08:27.560 --> 08:29.220
H-Help me!

08:29.220 --> 08:30.800
Wh-What's going on?!

08:34.460 --> 08:36.370
A rabbit? Wait—

08:36.370 --> 08:37.830
It's <i>huge!</i>

08:41.940 --> 08:43.610
I-It's going to eat me!

08:43.610 --> 08:46.030
Are the rabbits in this world carnivorous?!

08:50.670 --> 08:51.590
<b>Spearmanship</b>

08:50.670 --> 08:51.590
<b>Skill</b>

08:50.670 --> 08:51.590
<b>Acquired</b>

08:51.590 --> 08:55.050
<b>Horned Rabbit</b>

08:51.590 --> 08:55.050
<b>The horns are ingredients for cold medicine.</b>

08:51.860 --> 08:55.040
Whoa! A beginner like 
me won my first battle?

08:55.040 --> 08:57.200
Is this from Lady Nolyn's blessing?

08:57.200 --> 08:58.340
Thank you!

08:58.340 --> 09:01.160
No, I didn't extend my blessing 
down to such minor aspects.

09:01.160 --> 09:02.300
That's just coincidence.

09:02.310 --> 09:02.660
<b>None</b>

09:02.310 --> 09:04.520
<b>Job</b>

09:02.410 --> 09:04.520
<b>Warrior</b>

09:03.690 --> 09:04.510
Huh?!

09:04.510 --> 09:06.730
But I didn't want that!

09:06.730 --> 09:08.480
Thank you, mister!

09:08.750 --> 09:10.440
Oh, are you hurt?

09:10.440 --> 09:11.450
No.

09:11.450 --> 09:13.010
Where are you from?

09:13.010 --> 09:14.130
Bord Village.

09:14.130 --> 09:17.650
I was picking medicinal herbs 
and strayed into the forest.

09:17.650 --> 09:18.820
A village?

09:18.820 --> 09:21.170
Would it be alright if I came with you?

09:21.170 --> 09:22.790
Yes, of course!

09:22.790 --> 09:25.880
You're a big help. I was almost 
going to camp outside tonight.

09:25.880 --> 09:28.070
Aren't you going to take the Horned Rabbit?

09:28.070 --> 09:29.300
They're really yummy.

09:29.300 --> 09:30.640
Oh, right.

09:31.450 --> 09:34.500
<i>It said it couldn't hold living 
creatures, but a carcass...</i>

09:35.410 --> 09:37.290
Good. Let's go.

09:37.290 --> 09:39.150
Mister, you're incredible!

09:39.150 --> 09:40.090
<i>Oh, shoot!</i>

09:40.590 --> 09:43.630
<i>I had set Item Box to be concealed!</i>

09:40.600 --> 09:44.310
<b>Unique Skills</b>

09:40.600 --> 09:44.310
<b>Appraise EX</b>

09:40.600 --> 09:44.310
<b>Item Box EX</b>

09:40.600 --> 09:44.310
<b>Concealed</b>

09:40.600 --> 09:44.310
<b>Active Skills</b>

09:44.630 --> 09:45.950
I'm Molly.

09:45.950 --> 09:47.520
I'm Takumi.

09:49.020 --> 09:53.030
<b>Holy Sidonia Empire</b>

09:56.350 --> 09:58.690
What is... this?

09:58.960 --> 10:01.160
Akane! Are you hurt?

10:01.160 --> 10:04.620
No, but what happened?

10:04.940 --> 10:08.070
There was a light that whooshed up...

10:08.070 --> 10:09.580
Welcome, heroes.

10:10.060 --> 10:13.550
You have my deepest gratitude for 
responding to our summons.

10:13.550 --> 10:14.810
Summons?

10:14.810 --> 10:16.520
Where are we?!

10:16.760 --> 10:19.220
This is not the world you know,

10:19.710 --> 10:22.170
but another world entirely.

10:22.170 --> 10:23.640
Huh?!

10:24.060 --> 10:30.350
We have summoned you here to use your 
power as heroes to save this world.

10:30.350 --> 10:31.750
Cut the crap!

10:31.750 --> 10:34.180
I don't understand anything you're saying!

10:34.490 --> 10:35.830
You have a point there.

10:35.830 --> 10:38.720
Though we shall explain the 
details in the time to come...

10:39.990 --> 10:41.520
First, allow me to introduce myself...

10:41.920 --> 10:45.620
I am the First Empress of 
this Holy Sidonia Empire,

10:45.930 --> 10:47.620
Elizabeth.

10:54.670 --> 10:57.090
<b>Unique Skill</b>

10:54.670 --> 10:57.090
<b>Revelation</b>

10:54.670 --> 10:57.090
<b>Acquired</b>

10:55.420 --> 10:57.090
<b>Revelation</b>

10:55.420 --> 10:57.090
<b>A Blessing from Lady Nolyn</b>

10:55.420 --> 10:57.090
<b>Concealed</b>

10:57.410 --> 11:01.940
<i>"If you follow your instincts, then you will 
naturally arrive at the correct response"?</i>

11:02.550 --> 11:05.520
<i>This woman cannot be trusted.</i>

11:05.900 --> 11:06.850
<i>She's dangerous.</i>

11:11.340 --> 11:14.020
Thank you for rescuing our daughter.

11:14.330 --> 11:16.060
I'm Banga, a hunter.

11:16.060 --> 11:17.520
This is my wife, Martha.

11:17.520 --> 11:19.360
Thank you so much.

11:19.650 --> 11:23.950
Takumi, you're a good man, traveling to 
collect ingredients at such a young age.

11:23.950 --> 11:25.070
Thanks.

11:25.070 --> 11:29.900
So, I was wondering if I might be able to 
stay in this village for a while.

11:29.900 --> 11:30.960
Of course.

11:30.960 --> 11:33.950
These lands are bountiful with 
ingredients for medicines, after all!

11:33.950 --> 11:36.750
Yeah, there's a vein of ore nearby too,

11:36.750 --> 11:39.020
so it's heaven for craftsmen.

11:39.020 --> 11:39.980
An ore vein?

11:40.260 --> 11:41.590
This guy's Bobon.

11:41.590 --> 11:45.020
He's a blacksmith, so he knows 
a lot about mining ore.

11:45.020 --> 11:47.200
Stay as long as you like, Takumi.

11:47.200 --> 11:48.540
We're happy to have you.

11:48.540 --> 11:50.440
Thank you so much!

11:50.440 --> 11:52.520
Welcome to Bord Village!

11:52.520 --> 11:55.230
Unfortuantely, the village 
doesn't have an inn.

11:55.650 --> 11:57.640
Oh, is that so?

11:57.640 --> 12:00.030
Why don't we just build you a home?

12:00.030 --> 12:00.840
Huh?

12:01.800 --> 12:05.510
Sorry it's a cramped lot, 
but this is all that's free.

12:05.920 --> 12:07.680
No, this is plenty.

12:07.680 --> 12:10.200
Alright, then let's all get to work.

12:10.200 --> 12:10.800
Yeah!

12:10.800 --> 12:12.830
<i>First, I'll need to level the ground.</i>

12:15.290 --> 12:20.260
<b>Skill</b>

12:15.290 --> 12:20.260
<b>Earth Magic</b>

12:15.290 --> 12:20.260
<b>has Leveled Up</b>

12:15.290 --> 12:20.260
<b>Skill</b>

12:15.290 --> 12:20.260
<b>Mana Manipulation</b>

12:15.290 --> 12:20.260
<b>Acquired</b>

12:15.300 --> 12:16.940
Incredible!

12:16.940 --> 12:20.260
Urk, that shaved away most of my mana.

12:20.660 --> 12:23.850
Takumi, you can use magic?

12:23.850 --> 12:25.420
Using it like that...

12:25.420 --> 12:27.730
D-Did I do something strange?

12:27.730 --> 12:29.340
Forget it!

12:29.340 --> 12:32.170
Alright, leave the next steps to us!

12:32.170 --> 12:33.670
Let's get this done first.

12:32.770 --> 12:34.350
Ready, everyone?

12:33.970 --> 12:36.770
<i>My new life is beginning.</i>

12:34.350 --> 12:35.230
Yeah!

12:36.770 --> 12:38.300
<i>This might not be so bad!</i>

12:40.540 --> 12:42.100
There we go.

12:42.510 --> 12:46.200
Thanks to my Woodworking,
Blacksmithing, and Carpentry skills,

12:46.200 --> 12:48.740
I've managed to get a set 
of furniture together.

12:49.250 --> 12:50.340
Hmm...

12:50.340 --> 12:53.110
I wonder if I can change this Job?

12:51.200 --> 12:53.600
<b>Level</b>

12:51.200 --> 12:53.600
<b>Condition</b>

12:51.200 --> 12:53.600
<b>Healthy</b>

12:51.200 --> 12:53.600
<b>Vitality</b>

12:51.200 --> 12:53.600
<b>Stamina</b>

12:51.200 --> 12:54.670
<b>Name</b>

12:51.200 --> 12:54.670
<b>Takumi Iruma</b>

12:51.200 --> 12:54.670
<b>Race</b>

12:51.200 --> 12:54.670
<b>Human</b>

12:51.200 --> 12:54.670
<b>Age</b>

12:51.200 --> 12:54.670
<b>Years</b>

12:51.200 --> 12:54.670
<b>Job</b>

12:51.200 --> 12:54.670
<b>Warrior</b>

12:51.200 --> 12:54.670
<b>Mage</b>

12:51.200 --> 12:54.670
<b>Mana</b>

12:51.200 --> 12:54.670
<b>Dexterity</b>

12:51.200 --> 12:54.670
<b>Strength</b>

12:51.200 --> 12:54.670
<b>Intelligence</b>

12:51.200 --> 12:54.670
<b>Agility</b>

12:53.080 --> 12:54.670
<b>Selectable Jobs</b>

12:53.080 --> 12:54.670
<b>Carpenter, Blacksmith,
Alchemist, Thief, Monk</b>

12:54.650 --> 12:56.730
Oh, I can change it!

12:56.730 --> 12:57.740
Then...

12:58.270 --> 13:02.150
Uh-huh, now <i>this</i> is the path I had hoped for.

12:59.630 --> 12:59.880
<b>Alchemist</b>

12:59.630 --> 13:03.090
<b>Blacksmith</b>

12:59.630 --> 13:03.090
<b>Years</b>

12:59.880 --> 13:00.000
<b>Alchemist</b>

13:00.000 --> 13:03.090
<b>Alchemist</b>

13:03.310 --> 13:04.790
Now then...

13:05.140 --> 13:10.290
<i>I have the Iron Ore, Silver Ore, and 
Copper Ore that I mined with Bobon.</i>

13:06.800 --> 13:10.760
<b>Silver Ore</b>

13:06.800 --> 13:10.760
<b>Copper Ore</b>

13:06.800 --> 13:10.760
<b>Iron Ore</b>

13:10.760 --> 13:13.220
<i>There's also Magic Iron Ore.</i>

13:10.760 --> 13:13.230
<b>Magic Iron Ore</b>

13:13.230 --> 13:16.940
<b>Magic Iron Ore</b>

13:13.450 --> 13:16.940
<i>If I remember right, it's ore 
that's become imbued with mana.</i>

13:16.940 --> 13:19.890
<i>Today I'm going to make these into ingots.</i>

13:16.940 --> 13:19.900
<b>Iron Ore</b>

13:16.940 --> 13:19.900
<b>Silver Ore {middle}</b>

13:16.940 --> 13:19.900
<b>Copper Ore {right}</b>

13:20.250 --> 13:23.080
<i>Normally that would require a 
large furnace to melt them in,</i>

13:23.080 --> 13:25.120
<i>but this is a fantasy world.</i>

13:25.120 --> 13:28.160
It's finally time to try out some Alchemy!

13:28.160 --> 13:29.870
Alchemy!

13:29.870 --> 13:32.060
Yeah, it has a nice ring!

13:32.770 --> 13:36.510
<i>Alchemy is generally comprised 
of five techniques.</i>

13:36.910 --> 13:39.640
<i>Decomposition, Extraction, Pulverization,</i>

13:39.640 --> 13:42.590
<i>then Synthesis and Recomposition.</i>

13:43.140 --> 13:45.980
<i>Once I've extracted the iron ore like this,</i>

13:45.980 --> 13:48.200
<i>I run Earth Magic through it.</i>

13:49.750 --> 13:50.900
I did it!

13:50.900 --> 13:52.420
An Iron Ingot!

13:52.260 --> 13:55.480
<b>Alchemy</b>

13:52.260 --> 13:55.480
<b>Skill</b>

13:52.260 --> 13:55.480
<b>has Leveled Up</b>

13:52.780 --> 13:55.470
The mana consumption is harsh.

13:55.500 --> 13:57.850
But I can do this!

13:57.850 --> 13:59.220
I'll keep hardening them up!

13:59.220 --> 14:02.280
There's a mountain of things I want 
to make from iron and copper!

14:10.390 --> 14:11.960
Mister Takumi!

14:11.960 --> 14:13.980
I've brought you dinner!

14:16.110 --> 14:18.590
Mister Takumi!

14:20.290 --> 14:23.840
<i>I got carried away and used 
so much mana I passed out.</i>

14:23.840 --> 14:27.830
<i>Martha then lectured me
about pushing myself too far.</i>

14:28.830 --> 14:31.240
<i>After receiving a
Healing Potion from Banga,</i>

14:31.240 --> 14:34.400
<i>I continued my alchemy
without any breaks.</i>

14:34.760 --> 14:36.400
<i>Though I had to hold back</i>

14:36.400 --> 14:39.000
<i>when Martha or Molly came to 
check on me on occasion.</i>

14:39.720 --> 14:42.750
<i>I extracted iron, silver, 
copper, magic iron,</i>

14:42.750 --> 14:47.320
<i>and a small amount of gold, lead, 
tungsten, titanium, and tin.</i>

14:47.320 --> 14:50.750
<i>I was able to make utensils and other tools.</i>

14:51.290 --> 14:52.660
<i>Phew.</i>

14:52.660 --> 14:55.850
Thanks to that, my Alchemist 
Level skyrocketed.

14:54.830 --> 14:56.500
<b>Job</b>

14:54.830 --> 14:56.500
<b>Alchemist</b>

14:54.830 --> 14:56.500
<b>Blacksmith</b>

15:04.600 --> 15:05.700
Okay, Takumi!

15:05.700 --> 15:07.590
Raise the temperature
with your fire magic!

15:07.590 --> 15:08.350
Right!

15:20.960 --> 15:21.910
Now!

15:26.870 --> 15:28.950
It's so beautiful!

15:28.950 --> 15:31.560
It's the finest piece I've ever smithed.

15:31.570 --> 15:40.790
<b>Job</b>

15:31.570 --> 15:40.790
<b>Alchemist</b>

15:31.570 --> 15:40.790
<b>Blacksmith</b>

15:31.880 --> 15:34.260
Once I make the sheath, it'll be complete.

15:34.260 --> 15:36.630
<i>My blacksmith level is 40?</i>

15:36.630 --> 15:38.940
<i>I'm trying to be an alchemist, though.</i>

15:38.940 --> 15:40.230
<i>I don't get it.</i>

15:41.080 --> 15:42.610
Potions?

15:42.610 --> 15:43.550
Yes.

15:43.550 --> 15:45.580
Could you spare a few for me?

15:45.580 --> 15:48.150
Sure, but they're all basic.

15:48.150 --> 15:49.180
That's plenty.

15:49.180 --> 15:50.970
I'm thinking of trying
to make potions myself

15:50.970 --> 15:53.400
using the medicinal herbs
I've gathered.

15:51.470 --> 15:54.010
<b>Hilkuk Herbs</b>

15:51.470 --> 15:54.010
Used for
Healing Potions

15:51.470 --> 15:54.010
<b>Kurpopo Herbs</b>

15:51.470 --> 15:54.010
Used for
Stamina Potions

15:51.470 --> 15:54.010
<b>Marill Herbs</b>

15:51.470 --> 15:54.010
Used for
Mana Potions

15:54.010 --> 15:55.180
I see.

15:55.180 --> 15:56.910
When they're done,
you can sell some to me.

15:56.910 --> 15:58.340
Of course.

15:58.340 --> 16:01.340
Please wait for me without 
getting your hopes up.

16:03.550 --> 16:06.620
Crushed Hilkuk herbs and water...

16:07.500 --> 16:12.160
The more I mix them, 
the more the color changes.

16:12.160 --> 16:16.610
This kind of brings back memories of 
experiments I conducted as a child.

16:21.910 --> 16:23.510
The color is different...

16:23.810 --> 16:25.440
I can feel mana in it, too.

16:25.440 --> 16:26.710
Why is that?

16:26.710 --> 16:29.700
Is it because I prepared the 
water with water magic?

16:30.050 --> 16:33.530
I want to learn recipes 
for lots more potions!

16:44.350 --> 16:46.920
I'm... at my... limit!

16:46.920 --> 16:48.480
C-Cure!

16:48.480 --> 16:50.010
Purification!

16:50.440 --> 16:51.970
Heal!

16:58.410 --> 17:05.330
<b>Poison Resistance</b>

16:58.410 --> 17:05.330
<b>Skill</b>

16:58.410 --> 17:05.330
<b>Acquired</b>

16:58.410 --> 17:05.330
<b>Paralysis Resistance</b>

16:58.410 --> 17:05.330
<b>Skill</b>

16:58.410 --> 17:05.330
<b>Acquired</b>

16:58.670 --> 17:04.210
Even if this is the quickest way to gain 
resistance and raise my Light Magic skill,

17:04.640 --> 17:07.820
this is rough!

17:08.400 --> 17:12.640
But thanks to that, I'm able 
to use purification magic now.

17:14.090 --> 17:16.050
<b>Huge Armored Boar</b>

17:19.060 --> 17:20.590
<i>That's...</i>

17:21.860 --> 17:23.920
<i>definitely a dangerous one!</i>

17:39.650 --> 17:41.190
Wind Cutter!

17:42.620 --> 17:43.880
Rock Ball!

17:45.570 --> 17:47.550
I can't hurt it <i>at all!</i>

17:47.550 --> 17:49.570
<i>Think... Think!</i>

17:49.570 --> 17:51.050
<i>There has to be </i>something!<i></i>

17:53.390 --> 17:54.390
Huh?

17:54.380 --> 17:58.840
<b>Unique Monster: Poison Spider</b>

17:55.470 --> 17:58.510
Huh?! <i>Another</i> monster in this situation?!

18:00.760 --> 18:01.640
Shit!

18:01.640 --> 18:03.750
It's targetting me from behind!

18:03.750 --> 18:05.890
<i>Huh? It's injured?</i>

18:07.720 --> 18:09.220
I won't make it in time!

18:18.980 --> 18:20.820
<i>My magic isn't having any effect!</i>

18:20.820 --> 18:21.860
<i>What do I do?</i>

18:21.860 --> 18:23.450
<i>Even physical attacks!</i>

18:25.170 --> 18:26.490
<i>There has to be something...</i>

18:26.490 --> 18:28.190
<i>...</i>something<i> I can do!</i>

18:29.020 --> 18:30.110
<i>There is!</i>

18:29.500 --> 18:30.500
<b>Intuition</b>

18:29.500 --> 18:30.500
<b>Skill</b>

18:29.500 --> 18:30.500
<b>Acquired</b>

18:31.070 --> 18:32.280
<i>It's all I have!</i>

18:32.710 --> 18:34.030
<i>It's a gamble!</i>

18:34.500 --> 18:37.010
<i>If this doesn't work, I'm out of options!</i>

18:37.410 --> 18:38.970
<i>Alchemy!</i>

18:38.970 --> 18:40.440
<i>Decompose!</i>

18:45.720 --> 18:47.470
It worked.

18:46.850 --> 18:48.190
<b>Martial Arts</b>

18:46.850 --> 18:48.190
<b>Skill</b>

18:46.850 --> 18:48.190
<b>Acquired</b>

18:46.850 --> 18:48.190
<b>Magic Combat</b>

18:46.850 --> 18:48.190
<b>Skill</b>

18:46.850 --> 18:48.190
<b>Acquired</b>

18:50.960 --> 18:54.620
I was saved by my crafting training.

18:55.400 --> 18:56.750
Are you okay?

18:57.650 --> 18:58.820
<b>Poison Spider</b>

18:57.650 --> 18:58.820
<b>Condition</b>

18:57.650 --> 18:58.820
<b>Dying</b>

18:58.810 --> 19:02.260
You were trying 
to help me, weren't you?

19:02.260 --> 19:03.420
Thank you.

19:03.420 --> 19:06.800
Did that boar injure your leg?

19:07.450 --> 19:08.320
Heal.

19:11.500 --> 19:13.340
<b>Poison Spider</b>

19:11.500 --> 19:13.340
<b>Condition</b>

19:11.500 --> 19:13.340
<b>Exhausted</b>

19:13.320 --> 19:15.440
Looks like you're good now.

19:15.440 --> 19:17.540
I'll be going, then.

19:18.920 --> 19:21.590
<b>Tame</b>

19:18.920 --> 19:21.590
<b>Skill</b>

19:18.920 --> 19:21.590
<b>Acquired</b>

19:19.930 --> 19:25.260
<b>Tame <b>Poison Spider?</b></b>

19:20.020 --> 19:22.390
Huh?! What do you mean "tame"?

19:22.390 --> 19:24.970
Wait, wait, I can make 
this spider a pet?

19:28.210 --> 19:30.680
<i>Don't look at me like that!</i>

19:30.680 --> 19:33.180
<i>Not with all eight eyes!</i>

19:35.510 --> 19:37.120
Do you want to come with me?

19:36.860 --> 19:38.150
<b>Poison Spider</b>

19:36.860 --> 19:38.150
<b>tamed</b>

19:38.370 --> 19:41.860
<i>Go... together...</i>

19:42.130 --> 19:44.330
It's kind of awkward if you 
don't have a name, huh?

19:45.330 --> 19:46.740
Maple?

19:47.280 --> 19:51.260
Because the pattern on your 
back looks like a maple leaf.

19:51.260 --> 19:53.450
Do you like "Maple"?

19:53.450 --> 19:54.460
<i>Yeah.</i>

20:02.350 --> 20:03.570
Did you evolve?

20:03.570 --> 20:05.130
<i>I evolved!</i>

20:03.590 --> 20:05.140
<b>Unique Monster: Killer Spider</b>

20:03.590 --> 20:05.140
<b>Rare Breed Evolved from a Poison Spider</b>

20:03.590 --> 20:05.140
<b>Rare Breed Evolved from a Poison Spider</b>

20:05.130 --> 20:07.140
<i>Maple happy!</i>

20:07.140 --> 20:09.450
<i>Follow Master!</i>

20:08.600 --> 20:09.850
<b>Name</b>

20:08.600 --> 20:09.850
<b>Maple</b>

20:08.600 --> 20:09.850
<b>Takumi Iruma's Pet</b>

20:08.600 --> 20:09.850
<b>Race</b>

20:08.600 --> 20:09.850
<b>Killer Spider</b>

20:08.600 --> 20:09.850
<b>Age</b>

20:08.600 --> 20:09.850
<b>Years</b>

20:11.530 --> 20:14.080
Wha?! A Huge Armored Boar?!

20:14.080 --> 20:16.430
Damn, you took down an incredible monster!

20:16.430 --> 20:18.410
Mister Takumi?!

20:18.410 --> 20:19.840
That's a big spider!

20:19.840 --> 20:21.570
Wha?!

20:21.570 --> 20:22.490
Oh, it's okay!

20:22.490 --> 20:24.600
She's a monster I tamed!

20:24.600 --> 20:27.610
Huh? You tamed a spider?

20:27.610 --> 20:29.820
Yes. It's just how things played out.

20:29.820 --> 20:34.150
Everyone knows you can't 
tame insect monsters.

20:34.420 --> 20:36.740
But you have, huh?

20:37.130 --> 20:39.730
More importantly, shall 
we all eat this together?

20:39.730 --> 20:40.660
Are you sure?

20:40.660 --> 20:41.860
Of course!

20:41.860 --> 20:42.830
Alright!

20:42.830 --> 20:44.430
Gather the villagers!

20:44.430 --> 20:46.350
We're feasting on meat!

20:49.170 --> 20:53.130
Here are the materials for leather armor, 
the fangs, and the leftover hide.

20:53.420 --> 20:54.920
Thank you so much.

20:54.920 --> 20:57.600
If you head to a city, 
you can sell the leftover hide.

20:57.600 --> 21:00.920
Where is the nearest big city from here?

21:00.920 --> 21:02.420
That's Bolton.

21:02.420 --> 21:03.820
Bolton?

21:09.070 --> 21:11.980
This village has become 
brighter thanks to Takumi.

21:11.980 --> 21:12.780
Yeah.

21:12.780 --> 21:17.650
Though he's not the kind of person to 
stay in such a small village forever.

21:36.780 --> 21:37.940
Mm-hmm!

21:38.330 --> 21:40.640
You're doing well, aren't you, Takumi?

21:40.640 --> 21:44.400
What are you hoping for from him?

21:44.400 --> 21:45.600
Hoping for?

21:45.600 --> 21:49.370
You granted him a special 
body and your blessing,

21:49.370 --> 21:50.320
but most importantly...

21:50.320 --> 21:53.780
You sent him one whole year into the past,

21:53.780 --> 21:57.020
before the Holy Sidonia Empire 
activated their summoning spell.

21:57.630 --> 21:59.790
There's no particular meaning to that.

22:01.970 --> 22:04.170
Takumi Iruma.
